      "content": "1. Compile all the petty cash code receipts for the past few months that have led to inconsistencies and cross-check them against your standard procurement cycles.\n2. Speak with employees responsible for managing petty cash at the Stuttgart facility to understand the justifications for using various codes.\n3. Implement real-time monitoring of petty cash transactions to automatically flag irregular amounts outside normal procurement ranges.\n4. Schedule a review meeting to reconcile these discrepancies with an auditor, to ensure accuracy before considering a full-scale forensic audit.\n5. Consider revising petty cash policies, including tighter controls and approval processes, to prevent future inconsistencies.",
